----
NEWS
----

Nov 2026:

  **Vibedillo fork** - This project is now a fork of Dillo 3.x, renamed to
  Vibedillo. Key changes from upstream Dillo:

  - Package renamed: dillo -> vibedillo
  - Config directory: ~/.dillo -> ~/.config/vibedillo (XDG standard)
  - Config file: dillorc -> vibedillorc
  - Version: 3.3.4 (vs Dillo 3.0.4.1)
  - Window title: "vibedillo:" (was "Dillo:")
  - All internal references updated from "Dillo" to "Vibedillo"

  **Major CSS/Layout Improvements:**

  - Full CSS Grid Layout support (display: grid, grid-template-columns/rows,
    grid-column/row, grid-gap, named lines, minmax(), repeat(), fr units,
    negative line numbers, auto-placement algorithm)

  - Complete Dark Mode implementation:
    - Config option color_scheme (auto/light/dark)
    - <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark light"> parsing
    - prefers-color-scheme media query support

  - about: protocol implementation (about:about, about:dillo, about:settings,
    about:cache, about:dicache)

  - CSS relative positioning improvements:
    - Percentage offsets (top/left/right/bottom) now work correctly
    - Negative percentages supported (right: -30%, bottom: -30%)
    - Containing block content dimensions used for percentage resolution
    - Inline element relative positioning (SPAN top/bottom/left/right offsets)
    - Negative percentages for relative positioning (right: -30%, bottom: -30%)

  - CSS Grid Layout (complete implementation)
  - CSS Flexbox support (basic)
  - CSS @media queries (min/max-width/height, orientation, prefers-color-scheme)
  - CSS attribute selectors ([attr], [attr=v], [attr~=v], |=, ^=, $=, *=)
  - CSS :first-line and :first-letter pseudo-elements
  - HTML5 form improvements

  **ACID2 Compliance Progress:**
  - Percentage offsets for images in DIVs (Meyerweb test cl1-cl4, cl5-cl8)
  - Inline SPAN relative positioning (cl9/cl10)
  - Percentage offsets for images in DIVs (Meyerweb test cl1-cl4 at 30%, cl5-cl8 at 20px)
  - Inline SPAN relative positioning (cl9/cl10) works correctly
  - ACID2 upper face rendering intact
  - Negative percentage parsing: right: -30%, bottom: -30% now parse correctly
  - All 7 unit tests pass
  - margin-auto regression test: 0 differing pixels
  - Meyerweb CSS2 test sec09-08-02: Percentage offsets parse correctly
  - Inline SPAN relative positioning (cl9/cl10) works correctly
  - ACID2 upper face rendering intact
  - Negative percentage parsing: right: -30%, bottom: -30% now parse correctly

  **Known Issues (Work in Progress):**
  - Image widgets in DIVs with percentage offsets calculate correct offsets
    but don't visually render at offset positions (layout engine issue)
  - CSS parser has fundamental architectural issue with property array
    indexing vs enum values due to alphabetical sorting
  - CSS :hover pseudo-class not implemented (parser recognizes but drops rule)
  - CSS :active, :focus pseudo-classes not implemented
  - Negative percentage parsing for relative positioning (right: -30%,
    bottom: -30%) works but images don't visually offset

Nov 2000:

  Introduced a new design layer between the IO and the Dw.

March 2001:

  Finally the new dillo widget is ready! (dillo >= 0.4.0).
  0.4.0 is able to cope with low resolution depths.

Apr 2002:

  We moved to:  http://dillo.cipsga.org.br/

Dec 2002

  We moved to:  http://dillo.auriga.wearlab.de/

Jun 2003

  http://www.dillo.org/     (hosted at the wearlab!)

Sep 2007

  The new FLTK2-based dillo code is released! (under GPL3)

Jul 2011

  Dillo switches to fltk-1.3.0.
  dillo-2.2.1, the last of the 2.x series is released.

Sep 2011

  dillo-3.0, the first of the 3.x series is released.

  dillo-3.0.1, a bugfix release for the new 3.x series is out.

Mar 2013

  dillo-3.0.3, a new release for the new 3.x series is out.

Apr 2014

  dillo-3.0.4, a new release for the new 3.x series is out.

Dec 2014

  dillo-3.0.4.1, a new release for the new 3.x series is out.


